WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.280
Gwyneth Paltrow has spent plenty of time in
the Marvel Cinematic Universe, but her memories

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.920
seem to be a little shaky.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:11.220
The Academy Award-winning actress, who played
Pepper Potts opposite Robert Downey Jr.'s

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:15.660
Tony Stark across seven Marvel movies, has
admitted that she hasn't seen many of the

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.160
Marvel movies she's been in - particularly
2017's Spider-Man: Homecoming.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.880
She spilled the fact to late-night host Jimmy
Kimmel during a recent interview.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.120
Paltrow made waves regarding her small role
in Homecoming - for which she received top

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.230
billing, even beating out Zendaya for the
fourth credit - after she infamously argued

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:37.510
with MCU co-star Jon Favreau during the inaugural
episode of his Netflix series The Chef Show

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.500
about whether or not she was in the movie.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.160
Paltrow, in fact, seemed a little confused
about the entire situation.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.800
"Thanks for having me!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.140
I mean, thanks for coming!"

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.980
But it was undeniably funny when she insisted
that she never appeared in Homecoming, despite

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:53.600
Favreau's assurances that she definitely did.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.300
"You were in Spider-man."

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:55.980
"No."

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:56.480
"Yeah."

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:57.820
"I was in Avengers."

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.320
"You were in Spider-man also."

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.060
Her confusion makes a degree of sense.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:06.899
Marvel is famously secretive about the content
of its upcoming films, even altering trailer

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.940
footage to throw fans off the scent.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:13.579
Actors appearing in Marvel Studios films don't
always know the details of the movies they're

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:14.220
in, either.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:18.679
For example, Brie Larson confessed she didn't
know she was in Avengers: Endgame until she

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:19.760
got to the set.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:24.140
During her appearance on Jimmy Kimmel Live,
Paltrow confessed that not only does she not

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:28.120
recall appearing in Homecoming, but she also
hasn't ever sat down and watched it.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.200
The reason why?

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.760
She she simply got "confused" because, quote,
"There are so many of these wonderful Marvel,

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.939
interconnecting movies," and she thought that
her role in the Spider-Man movie was actually

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.860
for one of the Avengers films.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:44.400
"I never actually saw the movie."

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.420
"Oh you didn't see the movie?"

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.560
"I mean, wait, cut that out!

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.560
Take that back!"

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:52.920
In response, Kimmel joked that he doesn't
expect the busy actress to stay up-to-date

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.680
on superhero movies, even ones that she's
in.

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.540
“You're Gwyneth Paltrow, you shouldn't be
watching Spider-Man.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.120
It would upset people."

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:04.480
Homecoming isn't the only Marvel movie Paltrow
has been in that she's never even seen.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.700
In an interview with Elle, Paltrow revealed
that she's skipped watching a lot of Marvel

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:13.150
films, since the franchise is so big, there
are so many superheroes to keep track of,

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:15.120
and she has other priorities in life.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.300
Her confusion and busy life has led her to
not watch very many Marvel movies, which,

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:24.239
in turn, has made Paltrow totally forget which
MCU films she's starred in.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.480
She told the magazine,

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:30.160
"It is confusing because there are so many
Marvel movies, and to be honest, I haven't

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.440
seen very many of them.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:35.500
It's really stupid and I'm sorry, but I'm
a 47-year-old mother."

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.280
This isn't the first time the Marvel star
has appeared confused about the cinematic

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.740
universe she's a part of.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:46.160
She's forgotten Sebastian Stan — aka Bucky
Barnes — multiple times, having asked who

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:51.060
Stan was on a red carpet and getting called
out by Stan himself in an Instagram post after

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.020
he introduced himself to her three separate
times.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:59.900
And Marvel Studios president Kevin Feige previously
spilled that Paltrow was "asking why Sam Jackson

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.220
was there" when they were filming a scene
for Avengers: Endgame together.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.220
He recalled,

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:07.760
"The other actors were jumping in saying,
'What are you talking about?

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.840
He's Nick Fury!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.540
You've been in movies with him!'"

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:14.299
During the same Kimmel interview in which
Paltrow told the truth about whether or not

00:03:14.299 --> 00:03:18.379
she'd bothered to watch Spider-Man: Homecoming,
she was also caught off guard when presented

00:03:18.379 --> 00:03:22.730
with products from her lifestyle brand and
online store, Goop, which sells everything

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:27.159
from martini bath salts to a water bottle
that has an amethyst inside of it, for some

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.620
inexplicable reason.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.140
Throughout Kimmel's presentation, Paltrow
seems positively puzzled over the vast majority

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:37.020
of the products, leading viewers to wonder
if she's ever looked at Goop's inventory at

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.020
all.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.020
"Apparently, it's really from camel.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.180
Are you going to try some?"

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.299
It might seem absurd that Paltrow forgets
everything from her acting credits to her

00:03:46.299 --> 00:03:51.120
own merchandise, but at the very least, the
star is providing plenty of amusing press

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:56.769
clips for her huge variety of projects - such
a huge variety, in fact, that it seems impossible

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:58.220
for her to remember them all.

